@startuml
title Action 域实体关系
hide methods
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false

class Action <<aggregate root>> {
  +actionId: UUID
  +sourceDomain: SourceDomain
  +actionKind: String
  +title: String
  +status: ActionStatus
  +active: Boolean
  +deadline: Instant?
  +pinned: Boolean
  +pinnedAt: Instant?
  +completionMode: CompletionMode?
  +generationRuleVersion: String
  +sourceObjectVersion: String
  +priorityBand: PriorityBand
  +prioritySortKey: String
  +version: Integer
}

class TargetRef <<value object>> {
  +targetType: TargetType
  +targetId: String
  +routeHint: String?
  +focusKey: String?
}

class ActionGenerationEvidence {
  +generationEvidenceId: UUID
  +eventId: String
  +eventType: String
  +sourceObjectVersion: String
  +ruleId: String
  +ruleVersion: String
  +reasonCode: String
  +explanation: String
  +createdAt: Instant
}

class ActionPriorityEvidence {
  +priorityEvidenceId: UUID
  +calculationId: UUID
  +factor: PriorityFactor
  +factValue: String
  +effectiveOrder: Integer
  +ruleVersion: String
  +explanation: String
  +calculatedAt: Instant
}

class ActionDependency {
  +dependencyId: UUID
  +conditionRef: String?
  +status: DependencyStatus
  +reason: String
  +resolvedAt: Instant?
}

class ActionDecision {
  +actionDecisionId: UUID
  +operation: ActionOperation
  +reason: String?
  +actor: USER
  +basedOnVersion: Integer
  +createdAt: Instant
}

class DomainEventReceipt {
  +eventId: String
  +consumer: String
  +sourceDomain: SourceDomain
  +targetId: String
  +sourceVersion: String
  +status: ReceiptStatus
  +errorCode: String?
  +receivedAt: Instant
  +processedAt: Instant?
}

Action "1" *-- "1" TargetRef
Action "1" *-- "1..*" ActionGenerationEvidence
Action "1" *-- "0..*" ActionPriorityEvidence
Action "1" *-- "0..*" ActionDecision
ActionDependency "*" --> "1" Action : blocked
ActionDependency "*" --> "0..1" Action : blocking
DomainEventReceipt "1" --> "0..*" Action : affects

note right of Action
  活动业务键唯一（active=true）；
  status: OPEN/BLOCKED/COMPLETED/
  IGNORED/STALE；
  操作: PIN/UNPIN/COMPLETE/
  IGNORE/RESTORE；
  Home Actions 仅 Action 域拥有。
end note

note bottom of ActionPriorityEvidence
  固定比较顺序：
  deadline → blocker → user pin
  → system suggestion。
end note

note bottom of ActionDependency
  禁止自依赖和活动依赖环。
end note
@enduml
